{"fileVersion":"1.0","metadata":{"title":"Atom Node Class","description":"Chemical atom instance class referencing an element and optionally a specific isotope.","created":"2026-08-18T17:45:00.000Z","modified":"2026-08-18T17:45:00.000Z","author":"","tags":["node-class","chemistry","atom"],"preferredViewer":"https://twilite.zone"},"nodes":[{"id":"atom-declaration","type":"declaration","label":"Atom Node Class Declaration","root":false,"position":{"x":0,"y":-520},"width":520,"height":390,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"atom-class","name":"Atom Node Class","version":"0.1.0","description":"An individual atom modeled as an instance of an element, optionally resolved to a specific isotope and charge state."},"intent":{"kind":"node-class","scope":"shared"},"declaration":{"kind":"node-class","targetMode":"artifact","defaultSurfaceId":"root","surfaces":[{"id":"root","kind":"port","label":"Detail","portNodeId":"atom-detail-view","viewNodeId":"atom-detail-view"},{"id":"detail","kind":"port","label":"Detail","portNodeId":"atom-detail-view","viewNodeId":"atom-detail-view"},{"id":"summary","kind":"port","label":"Summary","portNodeId":"atom-summary-view","viewNodeId":"atom-summary-view"},{"id":"icon","kind":"port","label":"Icon","portNodeId":"atom-icon-view","viewNodeId":"atom-icon-view"},{"id":"editor","kind":"port","label":"Editor","portNodeId":"atom-editor-view","viewNodeId":"atom-editor-view"}]},"nodeClass":{"contractVersion":"1.0.0","key":"atom","label":"Atom","meaning":"An individual atom that points to its element identity and may point to a specific isotope.","description":"The atom is an instance-level entity suitable for molecules and reactions. Element identity is referenced rather than duplicated; isotopeRef is optional, charge is integer-valued, and state is available for descriptive electronic or excitation state.","requiredDataKeys":["elementRef"],"nodeDef":{"key":"atom","ref":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/ideas/graph-native-chemistry/atom.node-class.node","source":"local","version":">=0.1.0","defaults":{"label":"Atom","size":{"width":420,"height":300},"color":"#7c3aed","showLabel":false,"data":{"elementRef":"","isotopeRef":"","charge":0,"state":""},"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}]}}},"dependencies":{"nodeTypes":["declaration","markdown","port"],"portContracts":["core"],"schemaVersions":{"nodes":">=1.0.0","ports":">=1.0.0"},"optional":[]},"authority":{"mutation":{"allowCreate":true,"allowUpdate":true,"allowDelete":true,"appendOnly":false},"actors":{"humans":true,"agents":true,"tools":true},"styleAuthority":"descriptive","history":{"rewriteAllowed":false,"squashAllowed":false}}}},{"id":"atom-contract","type":"markdown","label":"Atom Contract","root":false,"position":{"x":-650,"y":-30},"width":500,"height":360,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"atom-class"},"markdown":"# Atom\n\nAn atom is modeled as an **instance-level chemical entity**. It references an element rather than copying element properties.\n\n## Authored fields\n\n- `elementRef` — required durable reference to an Element\n- `isotopeRef` — optional durable reference to a specific Isotope\n- `charge` — integer net charge; `0` is neutral\n- `state` — optional descriptive electronic/excitation state\n\nProton count follows the referenced element's atomic number. Neutron count belongs to the referenced isotope when one is specified. Electron count is derivable from atomic number and charge, so it is not duplicated here.\n\nThis class is intended for atom instances used inside molecules, ions, reactions, and other chemistry graphs."}},{"id":"atom-editor-view","type":"port","label":"Editor","root":false,"position":{"x":-40,"y":20},"width":440,"height":390,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"atom-class","portId":"editor","name":"Atom Editor"},"view":{"intent":"editor","payload":"editor.web"},"editor":{"web":{"fields":[{"key":"elementRef","label":"Element Ref","type":"text","path":"data.elementRef"},{"key":"isotopeRef","label":"Isotope Ref","type":"text","path":"data.isotopeRef"},{"key":"charge","label":"Charge","type":"number","path":"data.charge"},{"key":"state","label":"State","type":"text","path":"data.state"}]}},"semanticLevel":"editor","visibilityRole":"editor"}},{"id":"atom-icon-view","type":"port","label":"Icon","root":false,"position":{"x":480,"y":20},"width":300,"height":240,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"atom-class","portId":"icon","name":"Atom Icon"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.icon","semanticLevel":"icon"},"semanticLevel":"icon","renderShape":{"kind":"html"},"html":"<div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:24px;background:#1e1b4b;border:3px solid #a78bfa;color:#f5f3ff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;overflow:hidden;'><div style='width:88px;height:88px;border-radius:50%;border:4px solid #c4b5fd;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:900 30px system-ui,sans-serif;'>A</div><div style='margin-top:12px;font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;color:#ddd6fe;'>{{data.elementRef}}</div></div>","visibilityRole":"browser"}},{"id":"atom-summary-view","type":"port","label":"Summary","root":false,"position":{"x":860,"y":20},"width":480,"height":270,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"atom-class","portId":"summary","name":"Atom Summary"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.summary","semanticLevel":"summary"},"semanticLevel":"summary","renderShape":{"kind":"html"},"html":"<div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:24px;background:#1e1b4b;border:3px solid #8b5cf6;color:#f5f3ff;padding:26px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;overflow:hidden;'><div style='font:900 28px system-ui,sans-serif;'>Atom</div><div style='margin-top:18px;font:700 14px system-ui,sans-serif;color:#ddd6fe;'>Element</div><div style='font:800 15px system-ui,sans-serif;'>{{data.elementRef}}</div><div style='margin-top:10px;font:700 14px system-ui,sans-serif;color:#ddd6fe;'>Isotope</div><div style='font:700 14px system-ui,sans-serif;'>{{data.isotopeRef}}</div><div style='margin-top:10px;font:700 14px system-ui,sans-serif;color:#ddd6fe;'>Charge: {{data.charge}}</div></div>","visibilityRole":"browser"}},{"id":"atom-detail-view","type":"port","label":"Detail","root":true,"position":{"x":320,"y":500},"width":620,"height":360,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"atom-class","portId":"detail","name":"Atom Detail"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.detail","semanticLevel":"detail"},"semanticLevel":"detail","renderShape":{"kind":"html"},"html":"<div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:26px;background:#0f172a;border:3px solid #8b5cf6;color:#f8fafc;padding:30px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;overflow:hidden;'><div style='font:950 32px system-ui,sans-serif;'>Atom</div><div style='margin-top:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:12px 18px;font-size:15px;'><div style='color:#c4b5fd;font-weight:800;'>Element ref</div><div>{{data.elementRef}}</div><div style='color:#c4b5fd;font-weight:800;'>Isotope ref</div><div>{{data.isotopeRef}}</div><div style='color:#c4b5fd;font-weight:800;'>Charge</div><div>{{data.charge}}</div><div style='color:#c4b5fd;font-weight:800;'>State</div><div>{{data.state}}</div></div></div>","visibilityRole":"browser"}}],"edges":[{"id":"atom-declaration-contract","source":"atom-declaration","target":"atom-contract","sourceHandle":"left","targetHandle":"right","type":"reference","label":"contract"},{"id":"atom-declaration-editor","source":"atom-declaration","target":"atom-editor-view","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"editor"},{"id":"atom-declaration-icon","source":"atom-declaration","target":"atom-icon-view","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"icon"},{"id":"atom-declaration-summary","source":"atom-declaration","target":"atom-summary-view","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"summary"},{"id":"atom-declaration-detail","source":"atom-declaration","target":"atom-detail-view","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"detail"}],"clusters":[],"settings":{"theme":null,"backgroundImage":null,"defaultNodeColor":"#1976d2","defaultEdgeColor":"#666666","snapToGrid":false,"gridSize":20,"edgeRouting":"auto","autoSave":false},"scripts":[]}